{
  "description": "Stellar life-cycle simulator — the learner picks a starting mass via slider or preset buttons and steps through the star's evolutionary stages from nebula to its predicted end state (white dwarf, neutron star, or black hole), on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
